---
InheritParentConfig: true

# The spec harness registers every file through a static registrar object built
# by a macro, and expectations are written as throwing lambdas. Five checks fire
# on that shape in every spec file, so they are off here and on everywhere else.
Checks: >
  -bugprone-exception-escape,
  -bugprone-random-generator-seed,
  -bugprone-throwing-static-initialization,
  -bugprone-unused-return-value,
  -misc-use-anonymous-namespace

# Rationale:
#   bugprone-exception-escape              expectations throw out of lambdas
#   bugprone-random-generator-seed         generated specs seed a fixed value on purpose
#   bugprone-throwing-static-initialization  the per-file registrar is static
#   bugprone-unused-return-value           setup helpers are called for effect
#   misc-use-anonymous-namespace           the harness macro emits static functions
